<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 200 MLN FOR NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 200 MLN FOR NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered 200 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills on Tuesday, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - April 15, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - July 15, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
